'''Sonic''' (ソニック, ''Sonikku'', '''Sonic''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sonic
|image = E 730.png
|first appearance = [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000¢ - 7,900¢
}}

==Enemy==
True to form, the Blue Blur is incredibly fast with a blistering 95 speed, being [[Immune to Freeze]] and [[Immune to Slow|Slow]] as well. His range is incredibly low, with his [[Omni Strike]] only reaching to 190. Sonic does have [[Knockback]] and [[Slow]], though they're an annoyance at best  and he generally doesn't pose a threat, as even given his full backswing cooldown he can be greatly hindered by his high knockback count.

==Strategy==
Spam units that can outrange him and he'll die very easily, like [[Dancing Flasher Cat]] or [[Dragon Cat]].

